-- name: Master Section
-- description: One row per valid 2024+ course section-offering, retaining the complete section and enrollment spine. Material, inferred-required/optional, OER/IA, ISBN/FormatType, publisher, and cost fields use the canonical #58 Course Materials Use population (post-2024, non-Canada, ISBN-bearing, non-supply, and not a no-details/no-materials placeholder). Use/NoUse and supply audit fields remain visible. Includes institution enrichment and persisted enrollment_assigned/enrollment_source (#32). Slice by period_sortable, control, level, sector, or state in the GUI notebook builder. Backed by a materialized table. Gotchas: period_sortable YYYY-N (4=Fall); state 'CAN'=Canada; *_cost_avg=(min+max)/2 (NOT a mean); seats_taken=9999 is invalid.
SELECT * FROM master_section
